  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HAI: OPIC ISPOS Dem Cult</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HAI: OPIC ISPOS Dem Kult</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Olof Palmecentret st&#xf6;djer det haitiska institutet ISPOS, the Institute for Adcanced Political and Social Studies. Projektet avser att st&#xf6;dja demokratiprocessen och st&#xe4;rka situationen kring m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter p&#xe5; Haiti.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Olof Palme International Centre supports the Haitian institute, ISPOS, the Institute for Adcanced Political and Social Studies. The purpose of the project is to contribute to the democracy process and strengthen the human rights in Haiti.</narrative>
  </description>
